    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying Scrap is a vehicle simulation and open world survival game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in which the player will need to fix up their pile of a car and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >scrap plane to work various jobs around the city and larger continent,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so that they can afford to buy bread and kvass</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with many odd jobs the player can commit crimes such as shoplifting,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Driving under the influence and smuggling. You could also sink some hoops in basketball , crash some pins in bowling or shoot some brain in an alternative version of Russian roulette crossed with blackjack.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying Scrap is a vehicle simulation and open world survival game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in which the player will need to fix up their pile of a car and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >scrap plane to work various jobs around the city and larger continent,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so that they can afford to buy bread and kvass</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with many odd jobs the player can commit crimes such as shoplifting,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Driving under the influence and smuggling. You could also sink some hoops in basketball , crash some pins in bowling or shoot some brain in an alternative version of Russian roulette crossed with blackjack.</p>",
